//! Wycheproof v1 ChaCha20-Poly1305, the INVALID set, part 2 of
//! 2 (30 vectors of the set's 60, every one a
//! `ModifiedTag`: bit flips at every tag position, the flipped
//! MSBs, the truncated-to-prefix shapes): `open` must answer the
//! `tag` row — witnessed as a negative sentinel from the helper's
//! handler — and hand back NO plaintext. The 9 source
//! `InvalidNonceSize` vectors are omitted by name: the API
//! answers a wrong-size nonce with the documented `assert` trap
